                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "broil",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16c34297-0bc7-3a33-a55b-14d9565ac61b",
                                        "entry_id": "d2ae84b8-2403-313c-9965-b6d133548d48",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A brawl; a rowdy disturbance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74574fd7-cf94-4878-81ff-420fd2780b98",
                                                "sense_id": "16c34297-0bc7-3a33-a55b-14d9565ac61b",
                                                "text": "come to broils"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b685ea2-1e28-42e5-892d-9325d42c906b",
                                                "sense_id": "16c34297-0bc7-3a33-a55b-14d9565ac61b",
                                                "text": "But to give the faireſt Play to every ſide of the Queſtion, I vvill own that there is a Haughtineſs, and Fierceneſs in human Nature, vvhich vvill cauſe innumerable Broils, place Men in vvhat State you pleaſe; but ovvning this, I ſtill inſiſt in charging to Political Regulations, that theſe Broils are ſo frequent, ſo cruel, and attended vvith ſo deplorable Conſequences."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4f868f3-a709-4c8e-ba7c-7edc7b72548c",
                                                "sense_id": "16c34297-0bc7-3a33-a55b-14d9565ac61b",
                                                "text": "\"Away with this prating dotard,\" said Front-de Boeuf, \"lock him up in the chapel, to tell his beads till the broil be over. It will be a new thing to the saints in Torquilstone to hear aves and paters; they have not been so honoured, I trow, since they were cut out of stone.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c00ab63-7b8f-4e66-93a9-ce96a09f2be0",
                                                "sense_id": "16c34297-0bc7-3a33-a55b-14d9565ac61b",
                                                "text": "So, I am safe emerged from these broils! / Amid the wreck of thousands I am whole […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "266b820a-3dc9-4510-a1b2-f2e8c9fad738",
                                                "sense_id": "16c34297-0bc7-3a33-a55b-14d9565ac61b",
                                                "text": "Since the provinces declared their independence, broils and squabblings of one sort and another have greatly retarded the advancement which they might otherwise have made."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "979d5a69-5217-4ac4-9129-519f67e31e4f",
                                                "sense_id": "16c34297-0bc7-3a33-a55b-14d9565ac61b",
                                                "text": "“I have never sought an unrighteous broil. I have never broken my word.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
